{"id":"f772254463855099","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/653_线性动态逻辑_LDL.md","title":"653 线性动态逻辑 LDL","display":"653_线性动态逻辑_LDL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{653}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{653}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\n\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{dia}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\n\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{dia}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>路径表达式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{step},\\quad\n\\operatorname{test},\\quad\n\\operatorname{choice},\\quad\n\\operatorname{seq},\\quad\n\\operatorname{star}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{step},\\quad\n\\operatorname{test},\\quad\n\\operatorname{choice},\\quad\n\\operatorname{seq},\\quad\n\\operatorname{star}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示约定为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rho\\rangle A=\\operatorname{dia}(\\rho,A),\\quad\nA?=\\operatorname{test}(A),\\quad\n\\rho+\\sigma=\\operatorname{choice}(\\rho,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\rho;\\sigma=\\operatorname{seq}(\\rho,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\rho^\\ast=\\operatorname{star}(\\rho).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle\\rho\\rangle A=\\operatorname{dia}(\\rho,A),\\quad\nA?=\\operatorname{test}(A),\\quad\n\\rho+\\sigma=\\operatorname{choice}(\\rho,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\rho;\\sigma=\\operatorname{seq}(\\rho,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\rho^\\ast=\\operatorname{star}(\\rho).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生公式记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式与路径表达式\">2. 公式与路径表达式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Frm}_{653},\\mathsf{Path}_{653})\">\\((\\mathsf{Frm}_{653},\\mathsf{Path}_{653})\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小二元集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{653}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{653}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dia}(\\rho,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(\\operatorname{dia}(\\rho,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{step}\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\operatorname{step}\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{test}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\operatorname{test}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{choice}(\\rho,\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\operatorname{choice}(\\rho,\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seq}(\\rho,\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\operatorname{seq}(\\rho,\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{star}(\\rho)\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\operatorname{star}(\\rho)\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ClosedPair}_{653}\">\\(\\mathsf{ClosedPair}_{653}\\)</span> 为满足上述十条的全部有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F,R)\">\\((F,R)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}=\\bigcap_{(F,R)\\in\\mathsf{ClosedPair}_{653}}F,\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Path}_{653}=\\bigcap_{(F,R)\\in\\mathsf{ClosedPair}_{653}}R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}=\\bigcap_{(F,R)\\in\\mathsf{ClosedPair}_{653}}F,\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Path}_{653}=\\bigcap_{(F,R)\\in\\mathsf{ClosedPair}_{653}}R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由命题名\">3. 自由命题名</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FF}_{653}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{653}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FP}_{653}:\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{653})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FF}_{653}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{653}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FP}_{653}:\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{653})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(\\langle\\rho\\rangle A)=\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(\\langle\\rho\\rangle A)=\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\operatorname{step})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\operatorname{step})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(A?)=\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(A?)=\\operatorname{FF}_{653}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho+\\sigma)=\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho+\\sigma)=\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho;\\sigma)=\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho;\\sigma)=\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho^\\ast)=\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho^\\ast)=\\operatorname{FP}_{653}(\\rho).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有绑定构造子，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,653}\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\cup\\mathsf{Path}_{653})^2\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,653}\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\cup\\mathsf{Path}_{653})^2\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\equiv_{\\alpha,653}K\">\\(J\\equiv_{\\alpha,653}K\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,K\">\\(J,K\\)</span> 同属 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span> 且为同一构造树，或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,K\">\\(J,K\\)</span> 同属 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span> 且为同一构造树。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>定义同时递归的替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FSub}_{653}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}_{653}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{653},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FSub}_{653}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}_{653}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{653},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RSub}_{653}:\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}_{653}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\to\\mathsf{Path}_{653}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RSub}_{653}:\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}_{653}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\to\\mathsf{Path}_{653}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(q)[p:=B]=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;q=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{atom}(q),&amp;q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(q)[p:=B]=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;q=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{atom}(q),&amp;q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[p:=B]=\\bot,\\quad\n(\\neg A)[p:=B]=\\neg(A[p:=B]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[p:=B]=\\bot,\\quad\n(\\neg A)[p:=B]=\\neg(A[p:=B]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\to C[p:=B],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\to C[p:=B],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\langle\\rho\\rangle A)[p:=B]=\\langle\\rho[p:=B]\\rangle(A[p:=B]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\langle\\rho\\rangle A)[p:=B]=\\langle\\rho[p:=B]\\rangle(A[p:=B]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>路径表达式替换子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{step}[p:=B]=\\operatorname{step},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{step}[p:=B]=\\operatorname{step},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A?)[p:=B]=(A[p:=B])?,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A?)[p:=B]=(A[p:=B])?,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\rho+\\sigma)[p:=B]=\\rho[p:=B]+\\sigma[p:=B],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\rho+\\sigma)[p:=B]=\\rho[p:=B]+\\sigma[p:=B],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\rho;\\sigma)[p:=B]=\\rho[p:=B];\\sigma[p:=B],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\rho;\\sigma)[p:=B]=\\rho[p:=B];\\sigma[p:=B],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\rho^\\ast)[p:=B]=(\\rho[p:=B])^\\ast.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\rho^\\ast)[p:=B]=(\\rho[p:=B])^\\ast.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义以下命题公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{653}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{653}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{653}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{653}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{653}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{653}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义以下 LDL 路径公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ChoiceL}^{653}\n=\n\\{\\langle\\rho\\rangle A\\to\\langle\\rho+\\sigma\\rangle A:\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{ChoiceL}^{653}\n=\n\\{\\langle\\rho\\rangle A\\to\\langle\\rho+\\sigma\\rangle A:\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ChoiceR}^{653}\n=\n\\{\\langle\\sigma\\rangle A\\to\\langle\\rho+\\sigma\\rangle A:\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{ChoiceR}^{653}\n=\n\\{\\langle\\sigma\\rangle A\\to\\langle\\rho+\\sigma\\rangle A:\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{653}\n=\n\\{\\langle\\rho;\\sigma\\rangle A\\to\\langle\\rho\\rangle\\langle\\sigma\\rangle A:\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\rho\\rangle\\langle\\sigma\\rangle A\\to\\langle\\rho;\\sigma\\rangle A:\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{653}\n=\n\\{\\langle\\rho;\\sigma\\rangle A\\to\\langle\\rho\\rangle\\langle\\sigma\\rangle A:\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\rho\\rangle\\langle\\sigma\\rangle A\\to\\langle\\rho;\\sigma\\rangle A:\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Test}^{653}\n=\n\\{\\langle A?\\rangle B\\to A:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\langle A?\\rangle B\\to B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Test}^{653}\n=\n\\{\\langle A?\\rangle B\\to A:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\langle A?\\rangle B\\to B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{StarBase}^{653}\n=\n\\{A\\to\\langle\\rho^\\ast\\rangle A:\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{StarBase}^{653}\n=\n\\{A\\to\\langle\\rho^\\ast\\rangle A:\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{653}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{ChoiceL}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{ChoiceR}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Test}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{StarBase}^{653}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{653}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{ChoiceL}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{ChoiceR}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Test}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{StarBase}^{653}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{653}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{653}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{DiaMon}^{653}\n=\n\\{((A\\to B),\\langle\\rho\\rangle A\\to\\langle\\rho\\rangle B):\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{DiaMon}^{653}\n=\n\\{((A\\to B),\\langle\\rho\\rangle A\\to\\langle\\rho\\rangle B):\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{653}\n=\n\\{((A\\to B,\\ \\langle\\rho\\rangle B\\to B),\\langle\\rho^\\ast\\rangle A\\to B):\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{653}\n=\n\\{((A\\to B,\\ \\langle\\rho\\rangle B\\to B),\\langle\\rho^\\ast\\rangle A\\to B):\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{653}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{DiaMon}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{653}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{653}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{DiaMon}^{653}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{653}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{653}(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{653}(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad m&gt;0,\\qquad A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\text{ 对所有 }i&lt;m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad m&gt;0,\\qquad A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}\\text{ 对所有 }i&lt;m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{653}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{653}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{DiaMon}^{653}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{DiaMon}^{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{653}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{653}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{653}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{653}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{653}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{653}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{653}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{653}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{653}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{653}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{653}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-无限-trace-与路径匹配语义\">9. 无限 trace 与路径匹配语义</h1>\n<p>定义无限 trace 集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Trace}_{653}=\\{\\ell:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{653})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Trace}_{653}=\\{\\ell:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{653})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>同时递归定义公式满足关系与路径匹配关系，其类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{653}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{653}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{653},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{653}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{653}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{653},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Match}_{653}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{653}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathsf{Path}_{653}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Match}_{653}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{653}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathsf{Path}_{653}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>二者分别显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i\\models_{653}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i\\models_{653}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>和路径匹配关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i\\models_{653}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow p\\in\\ell(i),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i\\models_{653}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow p\\in\\ell(i),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i\\not\\models_{653}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i\\not\\models_{653}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i\\models_{653}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\text{not }(\\ell,i\\models_{653}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i\\models_{653}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\text{not }(\\ell,i\\models_{653}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i\\models_{653}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\ell,i\\not\\models_{653}A\\text{ or }\\ell,i\\models_{653}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i\\models_{653}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\ell,i\\not\\models_{653}A\\text{ or }\\ell,i\\models_{653}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i\\models_{653}\\langle\\rho\\rangle A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\ge i\\bigl(\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho\\ \\land\\ \\ell,j\\models_{653}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i\\models_{653}\\langle\\rho\\rangle A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\ge i\\bigl(\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho\\ \\land\\ \\ell,j\\models_{653}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>路径匹配子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\operatorname{step}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nj=i+1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\operatorname{step}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nj=i+1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}A?\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nj=i\\text{ and }\\ell,i\\models_{653}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}A?\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nj=i\\text{ and }\\ell,i\\models_{653}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho+\\sigma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho\\text{ or }\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\sigma,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho+\\sigma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho\\text{ or }\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\sigma,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho;\\sigma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\ (i\\le k\\le j\\land \\ell,i,k\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho\\land \\ell,k,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho;\\sigma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\ (i\\le k\\le j\\land \\ell,i,k\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho\\land \\ell,k,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho^\\ast\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists h:n+1\\to\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell,i,j\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho^\\ast\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists h:n+1\\to\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h(0)=i,\\qquad h(n)=j,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h(0)=i,\\qquad h(n)=j,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall m&lt;n\\ \\bigl(h(m)\\le h(m+1)\\land \\ell,h(m),h(m+1)\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall m&lt;n\\ \\bigl(h(m)\\le h(m+1)\\land \\ell,h(m),h(m+1)\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\rho\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Kleene 星的有限见证载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{StarWit}_{653}\n=\n\\{(\\ell,i,j,\\rho,n,h):\\ell\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{653},\\ i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\nh:n+1\\to\\mathbb N,\\ h(0)=i,\\ h(n)=j,\n\\forall m&lt;n\\ (h(m)\\le h(m+1)\\wedge(\\ell,h(m),h(m+1),\\rho)\\in\\mathsf{Match}_{653})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{StarWit}_{653}\n=\n\\{(\\ell,i,j,\\rho,n,h):\\ell\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{653},\\ i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\nh:n+1\\to\\mathbb N,\\ h(0)=i,\\ h(n)=j,\n\\forall m&lt;n\\ (h(m)\\le h(m+1)\\wedge(\\ell,h(m),h(m+1),\\rho)\\in\\mathsf{Match}_{653})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{653}^{\\mathsf{tr}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{653}^{\\mathsf{tr}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{653}\">\\(\\ell\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{653}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i\\models_{653}B\">\\(\\ell,i\\models_{653}B\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Gamma\">\\(B\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i\\models_{653}A\">\\(\\ell,i\\models_{653}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>线性动态逻辑的目标差异是路径表达式类别 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\">\\(\\mathsf{Path}_{653}\\)</span> 由测试、选择、顺接与 Kleene 星生成，并由公式构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rho\\rangle A\">\\(\\langle\\rho\\rangle A\\)</span> 调用。语义上该差异由位置间匹配关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathsf{path}}_{653}\\)</span> 给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LDL}_{653}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop}_{653},\\mathsf{ClosedPair}_{653},\\mathsf{Frm}_{653},\\mathsf{Path}_{653},\n\\operatorname{FF}_{653},\\operatorname{FP}_{653},\n\\operatorname{FSub}_{6